    <string name="google_warning_title">About Google</string>
    <string name="google_warning">Myap uses the web pages of Google Maps without an account or a key, the way a browser does. They are not a public API: they may stop working at any time, and their use may be against Google\'s terms of service. Every use sends Google what it says below, with your IP address. Myap never signs in and keeps Google\'s cookies in memory only (a new session each launch).</string>
