    <string name="routing_optimize">Routes are chosen for</string>
    <string name="routing_optimize_help">Fastest prefers main roads; Shortest the least distance; Eco few stops and climbs; Simple few turns.</string>
    <string name="routing_avoid">Avoid by default</string>
    <string name="routing_avoid_help">Tolls, highways, ferries, unpaved roads, steps and level crossings are left out where another way exists; narrow and unlit roads, hills and turns across traffic are taken only when they save much. Myap Router follows them all; other routers follow what they can, and the route says what may not have been avoided.</string>
    <string name="avoid_areas">Areas to avoid</string>
    <string name="avoid_areas_help">Routes stay out of these areas wherever another way exists. Add one from a place (Avoid this area) or during guidance (Avoid the road ahead).</string>
    <string name="avoid_areas_none">None</string>
    <string name="driving_side">Side of the road</string>
    <string name="driving_side_help">For avoiding turns across oncoming traffic</string>
    <string name="guidance_alerts">Warnings ahead</string>
    <string name="guidance_alerts_help">Level crossings, speed cameras, steep climbs and closures, on the screen and by voice</string>
    <string name="guidance_speed_limit">Speed limit</string>
    <string name="guidance_speed_limit_help">The limit where you are, from OpenStreetMap, and your speed in red above it</string>
    <string name="night_mode">Dark map</string>
    <string name="faster_routes">Faster routes</string>
    <string name="faster_routes_help">During guidance the route left is checked with live traffic (HERE, or Google when allowed) every few minutes.</string>
    <string name="faster_routes_look">Look for faster routes</string>
    <string name="faster_routes_accept">Take them without asking</string>
    <string name="faster_routes_accept_help">The voice says when the route changes</string>
    <string name="faster_routes_minutes">Offer when it saves at least</string>
    <string name="minutes">%1$d min</string>
    <string name="traffic_here">Live traffic of HERE</string>
    <string name="traffic_here_help">With a key of your own HERE account (developer.here.com), Myap Router uses the traffic of now: it routes round jams and closures, and checks for faster routes during guidance. Each fetch sends HERE the area of the trip and your key. Off while the key is empty. The key is kept on this device only.</string>
