    <string name="traffic_google_help">Google\'s traffic during guidance is a use of Google: turn it on in Settings → Google.</string>
    <string name="elevation">Elevations</string>
    <string name="elevation_help">Downloaded with each new region, for avoiding hills and the times of walking and cycling. The tiles of the area are fetched from the source chosen (it sees the area); they are removed once added.</string>
