    <string name="about_credits_summary">OpenStreetMap, OpenFreeMap, OSRM, Valhalla, Photon, Nominatim…</string>
    <string name="about_credits_text">Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Map tiles: OpenFreeMap and OpenMapTiles. Routes: OSRM and Valhalla on the servers of FOSSGIS. Search: Photon of komoot and Nominatim. Elevations: Terrain Tiles of AWS Open Data (Mapzen/Tilezen and its sources, including USGS 3DEP, SRTM, GMTED2010, ETOPO1, Copernicus EU-DEM), and 出典: 国土地理院 標高タイル (processed). Live traffic: HERE, with your key. The speeds of cycling on gradients follow the table of Valhalla\'s bicycle costing. The map is drawn by MapLibre Native.</string>
